<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title><%= title %> | Joel Victor</title>
  <%- include('partials/styles') %>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main class="projects-page">
  <div class="projects-intro">
    <h1><%= title %></h1>
    <p>Explore my coursework in networking, cybersecurity, programming, and web development.</p>
  </div>
<div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 g-4">
  <div class="col">
    <article class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
    <img class="card-img-top project-image" src="/images/vlsm.webp" alt="" loading="lazy">    
      <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h5">VLSM Network Design</h2>
        <p>I planned an IPv4 network by sizing each subnet for its host requirements and calculating its address range.</p>
        <span class="badge text-bg-light">IPv4 · VLSM · Subnetting</span>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="col">
    <article class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
    <img class="card-img-top project-image" src="/images/eigrp.jpg" alt="EIGRP router topology illustration" loading="lazy">    
      <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h5">EIGRP Routing Lab</h2>
        <p>I set up EIGRP on Cisco routers and checked routing tables to troubleshoot connectivity between networks.</p>
        <span class="badge text-bg-light">Cisco IOS · EIGRP</span>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="col">
    <article class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
        <img class="card-img-top project-image" src="/images/vrf.png" alt="" loading="lazy">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h5">VRF-Lite Network Lab</h2>
        <p>I used VRF-Lite to maintain separate routing tables and tested which devices could communicate.</p>
        <span class="badge text-bg-light">VRF-Lite · Cisco Networking</span>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="col">
    <article class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
        <img class="card-img-top project-image" src="/images/python.webp" alt="" loading="lazy">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h5">Python Programming Project</h2>
        <p>I wrote Python programs that organized data with sets and dictionaries and processed it with loops and functions.</p>
        <span class="badge text-bg-light">Python · Sets · Dictionaries</span>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="col">
    <article class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
        <img class="card-img-top project-image" src="/images/lan.png" alt="" loading="lazy">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h5">LAN Security Analysis</h2>
        <p>I studied common threats to local networks and how firewalls, access controls, and endpoint protection help reduce risk.</p>
        <span class="badge text-bg-light">LAN Security · Threat Analysis</span>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="col">
    <article class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
        <img class="card-img-top project-image" src="/images/website.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h5">Personal Portfolio Website</h2>
        <p>For Assignment 1, I built a four-page portfolio with HTML and CSS, adapted it for different screen sizes, and published it on GitHub Pages.</p>
        <span class="badge text-bg-light">HTML · CSS · GitHub Pages</span>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</div>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>